": "english", "review": "This game is fantastic! This game is the first in a long time that has inspired me to be a completionist. I have almost achieved my 100% complete goal, with achievements and items found. The only issue I have with it is the lack of in-game guidance for quest items and only because 1 item can open 5 different opportunities, and the only way to figure it out is to refer to an online guide, or take it to every NPC in the game and see if they can do anything with it.  I myself have completed 95% of the game without the help of a guide, and am currently over 700 hours invested in this game and I still find things that I haven't done or seen before. I can't remember the last game that has me coming back for more, even after all that time and over 60 full completions I am still drawn to it.", "timestamp_created": 1709243100, "timestamp_updated": 1709243100, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}]}